1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,367
Rule eight. Never ask what's behind
the Gray Gate.

2
00:00:04,067 --> 00:00:10,433
At the far end of the market, there's
a tall gray door in the wall. No
handle. No sign. And a quiet hum
behind it.

3
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:16,267
I'm not going to ask. I'm just going
to stand here. And stare. Like a
normal person.

4
00:00:16,967 --> 00:00:21,433
The hum stops. Three seconds of
silence. Then it starts again. Like a
breath.

5
00:00:22,133 --> 00:00:27,600
Whatever is in there, they don't want
us to know. And that makes it very
hard not to know.
